    "Method"], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "135bbe41-f345-475d-af69-ac72a368fda1"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "13ecc5b4-bb12-4884-b33c-f0f05d7ca3ab"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["Automatic"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "66f41932-e5cb-4955-afd4-dfc970a30180"],
     " (default), ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exhaustive\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "71e7ab0b-b16d-4c7f-abdf-07972c0ef246"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Exhaustive\>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Pruning\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "spec"}]}], "}"}]], 
      "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "052b86f1-615f-4223-a70e-a5d79df91c78"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "bb1a5ac8-1952-40b5-8893-f2784abaef8b"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<RandomGreedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "943b589a-b5b5-47a8-960a-911f69ba2ef3"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"c40dcf7c-6e11-43dc-aa54-d8beef3804a2"], 
    Cell[TextData[{
     "forwarded to the side geodesics. ",
     Cell[BoxData["Automatic"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "4a2753e4-bbb5-4863-ba57-a93f4561a3e2"],
     " resolves by the count: ",
     Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "d9b9161d-8506-4cb9-a2e9-bffd7312563f"],
     " to ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exhaustive\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "54805756-9120-4fbd-b257-7ef51dbaa270"],
     ", a bounded or absent count to ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "afd66b7b-8614-4129-8fd1-a72d6ee148b7"],
     ". The class is the same under every value; ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "8871bf17-db17-41d7-a732-35a0cf1f39ae"],
     " and ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exhaustive\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "a1fd7751-bcc4-48b8-aa79-107401469a75"],
     " take each side's geodesics in candidate order, ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<RandomGreedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "c196d042-bbab-4bff-81f9-1a64d555d67e"],
     " in random order, seeded by an ambient ",
     Cell[BoxData["SeedRandom"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "87852065-450a-4a72-a444-be9ab95d0a2b"],
     ". ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Pruning\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "641cdce0-2a6a-48a2-bfd1-d3984e10c93d"],
     " is accepted and inert: the sides come off geodesic pools, which have \
no frontier to cap."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"5fa0ba65-2980-43d9-81de-f02b4693626b"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"893176bf-e4a9-4360-8f03-\
b77d8d1d743e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Sides chosen by a local rule \[LongDash] straightest, curvature-minimising \
\[LongDash] are not a polygon option: build them with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["FindInfraGeodesic"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/FindInfraGeodesic", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "9ae0561b-4945-4734-b8d3-1ff32c7608fa"],
 " and assemble the ",
 Cell[BoxData["List"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1bbf0e19-5406-4d5d-81c1-7c57d0e53759"],
 " of sides."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"b73986a0-e272-4dfc-b50a-0bdd5a6fec8a"],

